{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026tTIO3rT1pb1794469597.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>政府修訂《教育條例》，引入教師執業證書要求等，相關條例草案明日刊憲。</p><p></p><p>條例草案將訂明法定要求，規定本港所有學校的教師，包括校長，必須持有教師註冊及執業證明書，方可在學校任教，證明書有效期不超過3年。當局相信，讓社會更認同教育專業，提升教師社會地位。另外，《條例草案》亦會設立防護機制，防止被裁定干犯國安罪行的人士在學校任教，以有效保護學生。</p><p></p><p>下周三將提交立法會，進行首讀及二讀。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T08:23:54.196622+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":189,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T06:58:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T08:37:18.593203+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T08:17:15.001143+00:00","content_hash":"ad7134b088eed0d94e186a28e7bdb50af74ea5f4c51043a71ef7c6e5a346db97","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T08:23:54.196622+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}